{
    "theme": "尋找物品",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天家裡要辦婚禮，很多親戚都來了。<br>看到大家忙得不可開交，主角決定要幫大家一起準備。"
            },
            {
                "text": "ino, maitan’e mo na’no botngonʉ ’emo cmʉ’ho ta emoo ci ’oahngʉ.",
                "textCh": "媽媽今天家裡來了好多親戚哦！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66287/924748",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "ta maitan’e te mevcongʉ ’o ohaeva su no hahocngʉ ko’ko mo botngonʉ ’emo esmi.",
                "textCh": "今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66287/924749",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "na’no ’aveoveoyʉ ! micu na’no nona’o o’a nala a’ta aiti.",
                "textCh": "好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66287/924750",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "’a zou eno ! te na’no man’i ci hioa maitan’e, teto so to’usnu ta botngonʉ.",
                "textCh": "對啊！今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66287/924751",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "zou, ’a te’o eno.",
                "textCh": "好的，我一定會！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66287/924752",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "te’o n’a smouyu’ho to tena matititha ci macucuma.",
                "textCh": "我要去準備等一下要用的東西了。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66287/924753",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "te’o to’usnu.",
                "textCh": "我來幫忙！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66287/924754",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "zou eno, naho no fiho a’o.",
                "textCh": "好，你跟我來！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66287/924755",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            }
        ],
        "phase2": {
